name unicode-radical-stroke-index
# RSIndex.txt is the UAX #38 radical-stroke index. Each row lists a
# radical/stroke pair and its individual Han ideographs, including supplementary
# scalars. The index's property and value form one content path; every listed
# ideograph is a separate member, rather than one concatenated string.
match RSIndex.txt
tier row by \n
comment hash
remark hash
padded
names index ideographs
tier field by \t
thing row literal kRSUnicode index
content index
part ideographs by space
codepoints ideographs
pair row ideographs
